<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka January rubber output up 3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka January rubber output up 3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's rubber output rose 3.1 percent to 10 million kg in January over the same period last year, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said rubber production in January last year was 9.7 million kg.</p>
</text>
